            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Demosthenes</strong><br>\nDemosthenes was born in Athens around 384 B.C. His father was a wealthy sword-maker, but Demosthenes had a difficult childhood after his father died when he was seven. The young boy's inheritance was mismanaged by his guardians, which led to him taking legal action against them when he reached adulthood. Despite these early challenges, his determination to improve his speaking abilities was evident from a young age, as he overcame a speech impediment through persistent training.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Demosthenes as an Orator</strong><br>\nAs an orator, Demosthenes wrote speeches for court litigants and began his career in the public eye by suing his trustees for mismanaging his inheritance. He is often cited as the greatest of the ancient Greek orators. His mastery of the art of rhetoric enabled him to sway public opinion and wield significant influence in the political arena of Athens.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Philipics</strong><br>\nDemosthenes is well-known for his series of speeches called the \"Philippics,\" which were named after Philip II of Macedon, the father of Alexander the Great. These speeches were intended to warn the Athenians about the threat posed by Philip and to stir them to action against Macedonian imperialism. Demosthenes passionately argued for the preservation of Athenian independence.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
